# Offer a choice
@scenario office_lesson_10
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk present]
pip: A teammate has two requests and there is only time for one. Route the response by label.
pip: Read the two destinations below the question. Change one response, then pick both branches.
@label check
pip: What does the arrow after a choice point to?
> A sprite expression. -> retry
> A destination label. -> correct
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: Each branch can perform different work before both paths meet. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: Each branch can perform different work before both paths meet.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_10]
[flag tutorial_done_10]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
